<body>
  <header>
    <div class="navwrap">
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Scent Lab</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Apothecary</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="reveal" id="lab-hero">
      <div class="intro">
        <div style="flex:1">
          <h1>Scent Lab: simple blends to try</h1>
          <p class="muted">Recipes are practical and safety-focused. Use the notes to adjust for pets, pregnancy, or sensitivity.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="width:220px" class="card">
          <strong>Workshop invite</strong>
          <p class="muted">Join a monthly Lab to mix full samples and learn dilution basics. Seats are limited.</p>
          <div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="book.html">Reserve a seat</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" id="recipes">
      <h2 style="margin-top:18px">Starter blends</h2>
      <div class="recipes">
        <div class="recipe">
          <strong>Calm Corner — Diffuser</strong>
          <p class="muted">3 drops lavender, 2 drops bergamot, 1 drop frankincense. May support a restful space. Avoid near cats; reduce citrus around young children.</p>
          <p><em>Notes:</em> 3–5 drops total for a small room.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="recipe">
          <strong>Wake-up Focus — Inhaler or Diffuser</strong>
          <p class="muted">2 drops rosemary, 2 drops sweet orange, 1 drop peppermint. Short inhalations may assist alertness for some people. Skip peppermint with small children.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="recipe">
          <strong>Evening Ease — Roll-on (3% dilution)</strong>
          <p class="muted">In 10ml jojoba: 5 drops chamomile, 4 drops sandalwood, 1 drop mandarin. Patch test on inner forearm first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="recipe">
          <strong>Grounding Mini — Personal inhaler</strong>
          <p class="muted">2 drops vetiver, 1 drop bergamot. Keep for desk use; inhale gently twice when you need a clear break.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" id="safety">
      <h2 style="margin-top:18px">Safety primer</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="muted">Always dilute essential oils for topical use and perform a patch test. Be mindful of pregnancy, medications, and animals—some oils should be avoided. If in doubt, choose milder plant aromatics and speak with a health professional before use.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" id="workshops">
      <h2 style="margin-top:18px">Lab sessions and what you'll learn</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:8px">
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Hands-on Lab — 90 minutes</strong>
          <p class="muted">Mixing basics, safety practices, and a guided attempt at a personal 10ml roll-on to take home.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Deep Blend — 3 hours</strong>
          <p class="muted">A more thorough exploration including scent journaling and sample exchanges. Great for small teams.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" id="cta">
      <div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
        <div>
          <h3 style="margin:0">Curious to try mixing?</h3>
          <p class="muted">Sign up for the next Lab or grab a starter kit from the apothecary.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a class="btn" href="book.html">Book a Lab</a>
          <a class="btn" style="margin-left:8px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);color:var(--accent)" href="shop.html">Buy starter kit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:var(--maxw);margin:20px auto;padding:0 20px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} · {{TAGLINE}} · <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
  </footer>

